{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17949","headline":"幽怀 · 韩愈","name":"幽怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽怀不能写，行此春江浔。\n适与佳节会，士女竞光阴。\n凝妆耀洲渚，繁吹荡人心。\n间关林中鸟，亦知和爲音。\n岂无一尊酒，自酌还自吟。\n但悲时易失，四序迭相侵。\n我歌君子行，视古犹视今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}